WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.080
You are my sun now

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.500
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.510
no matter who you are

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:36.930
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.410
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:59.910
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:05.250
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.920
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:16.760
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.940
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:38.280
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.300
<i>Lief and his companions departed
for Del Castle to rescue Dain.</i>

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:07.400
<i>Among them were the representatives of the seven tribes,
who took different routes to reach Del Palace.</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:13.350
<i>Their goal was to rescue Dain,
the heir to the King of Deltora.</i>

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.860
You called for me, my lord?

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.800
Fallow.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:35.800
I have suffered another great
loss due to your incompetence.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.500
M-My deepest apologies, my lord.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.300
B-But...

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:45.900
I have no idea what you mean by 'great loss'...

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.200
Orcus was defeated!

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.100
What?!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.800
O-Orcus?!

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.300
That simply cannot be!

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:54.600
Fallow.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.600
By my command, you shall work
to resolve this matter personally.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.100
Y-Yes my lord.

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.500
I will track them down immediately!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.700
That will not be necessary.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.200
Even at this very moment, they are
trying to sneak into this palace.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:12.860
What?!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:17.200
I shall have a great monster join you at your side.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.620
A great yet pitiful monster who holds
a grudge against those three, in fact.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.290
I see...

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:27.100
Listen carefully! I will not accept another failure.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.800
And if you do fail again,

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.800
you know full well what will happen, don't you?

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:34.500
Y-Yes.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.000
That much I know very well,

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.310
my lord.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:43.000
I'm relying on you.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.820
Those three are headed for the palace?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:55.100
Even though his real body is in the Shadowlands?

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.300
My lord really does know all.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:04.330
How did he get that information, I wonder?

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.340
I haven't a clue.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.400
Don't slack off!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.300
Check all of the cargo!

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.400
How troublesome. This is bad for business.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.850
It's gotten strict all of a sudden.
Did something happen?

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.070
I see. Thanks, Kree.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:50.500
Shit. There's this many of them,
even at the rear gate...

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.400
Where are we supposed to get in from?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.200
I've never seen this many guards before.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.000
We must have put them on high alert.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.900
Let's go.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:05.800
As expected, the surrounding area
of the castle is heavily guarded.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.000
It's crawling with Grey Guards.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.190
Breaking in head-on seems unrealistic.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.500
I wonder if the others are inside already.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:18.200
It did take us a little longer
thanks to Orcus, after all.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:19.900
This is a problem.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.600
We'll need a different strategy
to get into the palace.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.790
About that...

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.400
A map of the palace?

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.500
I got it from Manus.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.700
It's not the complete version, though.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.100
But either way, I noticed
something when I looked at this.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.000
Right here.

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.700
This line.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:44.400
I see... This might work.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:45.600
What do you mean?

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.200
Underground tunnels.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:53.000
Palaces have escape routes to be used by
the royal family in case of emergencies.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.900
So this is one of those paths?

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:56.000
Most likely.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.400
Let's check it out.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:01.370
As of this moment, nobody knows our
whereabouts except for the four of us.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:06.100
At the very least, we shouldn't have to
worry about that spy, unlike last time.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.100
That's right.

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:11.300
But, we still need to meet up
with Zeean and the others.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.200
We have no means of contacting them right now.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:18.700
Let's trust in our friends and
just do what we can for now.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:19.600
You're right.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.200
Understood.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:22.900
Right, let's go.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.800
Yep.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:29.000
To think there would be guards at this entry too...

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.940
But, there's only two of them.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.400
And they certainly seem relaxed.

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:38.700
Yes. I'm sure they can hardly imagine
anyone trying to get in from here.

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:39.450
Yeah.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.800
In this case, we can just force our way in. Let's go!

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.300
Good, that's that.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.670
Let's hurry inside.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.900
There doesn't seem to be anyone in here.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.560
I have to say, this really isn't a pleasant place.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:07.500
It's interesting that they have so many guards
posted in the area, even by a secret tunnel like this.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.320
They shouldn't be expecting people
to get in from here, right?

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:15.400
Or perhaps they're trying to
set up an ambush for us...

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:19.000
Even if that were the case, we can't turn back now.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.700
Dain is being held captive in here.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.900
That's right.

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.800
Well then, let's just continue onward.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.900
Yeah.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:33.100
I see...

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:37.600
They dug from the palace to this place,
connecting it to an existing cave.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:38.500
Let's go.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.700
This goes all the way to the palace?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:45.600
It's really well made.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:48.100
That just shows how important this tunnel is.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:53.600
There are probably others like it;
tunnels that weren't shown on that map.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:00.400
I think we should be getting
close to the palace by now.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:06.600
A dead end...?

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.700
The map doesn't show anything past this point.

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:13.300
I assumed that there would be an
entrance to the palace here, but...

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.830
There may be a hidden path.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.700
Right. Let's check it out.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:22.200
This doesn't look like something
that would open up.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.800
Barda, come here!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.300
How is it, Jasmine?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.600
Is someone in there?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:48.500
Right.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.490
Let's go!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:51.900
It's clear.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.300
The prison cells are that way!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.300
The prison cells are down there.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.190
There's a large door 10 metres from here,
and with two guards in front of it.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:22.700
A surprise attack is impossible from this distance.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.600
So we need to distract them
somehow and then attack.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.800
Leave it to me!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.000
What the hell is this?

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:35.500
Where did it come from?

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.200
Enemy attack!

00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.700
Barda!

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.180
It's the key to the door!

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.140
Dain!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.900
Are you there, Dain? It's me, Lief!

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:05.900
Lief?

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.000
Lief, please open this cell!

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Hold on, I'm opening it now.

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.300
Why did you all get captured?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.500
Lief, you came to save us!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.900
You did well to find this place.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.800
Well actually, we were looking for
Dain and found you by chance.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.510
What on earth happened?

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:38.400
Well, just as we were about to
reach the walls of Del Palace...

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.500
Let's close in slowly to keep silent.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.300
Right.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.800
Oh no! It's a trap?!

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:53.630
Give it up!

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.540
You can't escape!

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:57.800
Damn it all...!

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.100
It happened very quickly.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.540
It was as if they were waiting for us!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:07.750
We really did have nowhere to run.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:11.550
I wonder how they knew we
were going to be there.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:17.300
There's no doubt about it.
Our movements are being leaked.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:21.700
There are spies in our ranks besides Jinx?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.310
I really don't want to
believe it, but it appears so.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:28.300
What about Doom and the others?

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.700
We don't know.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.100
I hope they didn't get captured as well...

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.500
Dain...

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:35.570
Where are you?

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:41.290
Unfortunately, Dain wasn't here when
we were imprisoned here.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.300
Or could it be that he's not even in the palace...?

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:47.500
There's nothing we can do about
it even if that is the case.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.500
Let's regroup elsewhere.

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.200
Shall we return to that cave?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.440
Yes, we should.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.200
The guards are gone?!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.700
There were so many of them not long ago...

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.300
Did something happen?

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.400
Also, it's way too quiet.

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:11.400
Lief, look!

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.660
That's...

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:20.870
Dain!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.090
Dain!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.600
Lief!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.600
Wait... calm down, Lief!

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.100
Calm yourself, Lief.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:49.300
Do you really think it will do any
good to just mindlessly go to him?

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.900
B-But...

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:51.900
Dain is...

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:55.600
I know. We will do whatever
it takes to save Dain, but,

00:12:55.600 --> 00:13:00.200
If they've set up the execution platform in such a visible location, then...

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.370
Well, it must be a trap.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:07.000
They must have known that we
were coming here to rescue him,

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:11.000
so they built this extravagant
platform to lure us in.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.100
That's awful...

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:16.800
But... at this rate, Dain might really be executed!

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:19.100
What should we do...?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:23.400
We can't just go there knowing that it's a trap...

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.600
But even so, just standing
here would solve nothing.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.000
Well, you're right about that.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.700
Should we try sneaking in and
getting as close as possible?

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.240
Yes, that should be fine.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.500
We must also find some weapons for ourselves.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.600
Alright then.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:42.300
For now, we'll get close and assess
things once we're there.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.400
Is that fine?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.450
Yes.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.460
Are you awake, Your Majesty?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.750
How did you sleep in the
special bed we prepared for you?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:14:00.450
Building all this was a tough job, you know.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:03.180
Some gratitude would be much appreciated.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.300
That's a good one.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:13.200
It looks like the rats have taken the bait.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.690
Let's get started.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.200
Do it!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.500
Oil!

00:14:27.400 --> 00:14:29.700
Oh dear, are you shivering over there?

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:33.000
Don't worry, very soon it will be nice and warm.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.950
Hey, report to Lord Fallow.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.100
Tell him that the party is about to begin.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.200
Dain...

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.400
Not yet.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:53.100
We're sure to fail if we charge
head-on into that many of them.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.600
Let's wait for our chance.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:55.600
But...!

00:14:55.900 --> 00:15:00.800
The guards standing by Dain
are all armed with blisters.

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:06.000
If we run in there now, Dain may just
burn down in flames right then and there.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.300
But we can't just leave him like that!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.600
Of course not.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:14.200
But, running straight into a trap
won't do anything for us either.

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.200
But...

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.670
We have no choice!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.700
I feel the same way!

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.500
Lief!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.300
Honestly...

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:25.300
So, what should we do?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.300
It can't be helped. Let's go!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.200
Alright!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.800
Hold on, Dain!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:53.600
Lief!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.900
I'd say it's about time. Go!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.300
What?

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.500
They're retreating?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.480
Up above... something's there.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.600
I hate you all.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.600
I loathe you all!

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.000
I will make you all suffer.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.100
No!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.000
The one you should hate is the Shadow Lord!

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.800
I'm sad...

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:43.480
I hate... I loathe you all!

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.300
Leave him to us.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.900
You hurry up and save Dain!

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.400
B-But...!

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.100
Revenge for Mama...

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:53.390
Revenge for my siblings...!

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.000
It won't cut through!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.700
Barda!

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:09.490
Nanion!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.700
One of Thaegan's children, huh?

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.700
He's pretty good.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:22.200
That sorceress was a bit creepy, though.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.500
As expected of the Shadow Lord;

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.100
he has an eye for strength.

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.000
This should be the end for them.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.400
Well, one would expect results such as
these when I'm giving direct orders.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.350
Barda!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:44.600
Revenge for Mama. Revenge for my siblings.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.400
Damn you!

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:54.410
Lief!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.800
Lief! Don't worry about me!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.800
Just run away with the others!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.700
I can't do that!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.600
You're our precious friend, Dain!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.630
Lief...!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.400
Ichabod...

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.640
This world has to change!

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.400
Huh?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.600
What are you on about? Are you stupid?

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.400
I may very well be,

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:25.000
but, I can't just let the
Shadow Lord do as he pleases!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.280
And to that end, I will defeat you!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.300
Oh no!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.700
Lief!!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.600
Out of the way.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.700
No!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.700
I will protect Lief!

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.910
Again!

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.000
Mama!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.200
Looks like we made it in time.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.900
More like late!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.930
Lief!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.500
Lief...

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.850
Dain, we've finally-

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:44.300
You can talk later!

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:48.300
Listen, we're going to use this smoke to
retreat before the Grey Guards return!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.440
This way!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:35.000
We should be safe here for a little while.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.740
Dain, are you okay?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.200
Yes, no issues here.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.300
Thank you.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.500
I see.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:44.800
Thank goodness.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.400
Oh right, this...

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.600
Huh?

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.960
The blade is gone.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:53.900
I'm sorry, Dain.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.600
It looks like I lost your blade somewhere.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.500
That's fine.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:00.500
More importantly, everyone...

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:04.700
I'm sorry for putting all of your
lives in danger for my sake.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:09.700
Not at all. We need you to fulfill our wish.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.500
Right, Lief?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.400
Now, Lief.

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.700
Let us hurry and resume the ceremony.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.700
Yeah.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.240
Lief...

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:28.800
Given the circumstances,
it may not be a proper ceremony,

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.900
but we need you.

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:34.100
It took longer than expected,
but we've finally arrived here.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.260
The time has finally come.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.260
Come, Dain.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.100
Dain, heir of the king, please accept this.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.730
Dain?

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:14.700
I see, I see.

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:17.470
Dain?

00:22:19.100 --> 00:22:23.100
I understand. I will accept this
and put an end to it all.

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:28.430
But it won't go the way you've
all been hoping it will.

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:53.390
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:59.180
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.690
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:11.490
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:18.450
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.120 --> 00:23:22.040
At this point

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:27.710
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:34.050
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:40.350
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:47.440
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:55.820
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:09.100
The Seven Gems: the Emerald.

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:14.040
<i>The gem of the Dread Gnome tribe,
found in Dread Mountain.</i>

00:24:14.040 --> 00:24:15.600
<i>It represents honour.</i>

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:19.500
<i>Its colour fades when vows are broken.</i>

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:23.550
I felt a bond of friendship with you.

00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:26.900
We went on adventures together and talked often.

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:29.700
I had no doubt that you were the king's heir.

00:24:29.700 --> 00:24:31.700
And yet, you're...

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:34.820
Close Friend Dain's True Colours

00:24:32.100 --> 00:24:34.820
Next time, 'Close Friend Dain's True Colours'.

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
